# testscene_6: Tunnel of rings (fov 70): framing at the image border and depth
# Category: camera. Eighteen thin annuli receding from 1.3 to 60 units along a winding axis, a spiral of beads and a sphere at 75 units, seen with fov 70. The nearest rings are cut by the image border, so the field of view and the projection are compared pixel by pixel along every ring edge.
# Reference: testsuite_ref_6.pfm, rendered by pbrt-v4 from testscene_6_pbrt.pbrt (same scene; only Integrator, Sampler and Film differ).
# pbrt-v4 version of testscene_6.pbrt, used to render the reference image.
